<title>USA: Newcor Inc Q2 April 30 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>Newcor Inc Q2 April 30 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMFIELD HILLS, Mich. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands, Except Per Share Amounts)</p>
<p>				 Six Months Ended  Three Months Ended</p>
<p>			   4/30/97  4/30/96	  4/30/97  4/30/96</p>
<p> Sales		     $62,564 $50,388	  $34,589 $27,128</p>
<p>Income from continuing</p>
<p>     operations	    1,448   2,081	    1,082     834</p>
<p>Shr net from continuing</p>
<p>     operations	     0.31    0.44	     0.23    0.18</p>
<p> Shares Outstanding	4,700   4,683	    4,708   4,687</p>
<p>NOTES - Results do not include losses from discontinued operations of $3.9 million and $4.7 million in year-ago Q2 and six month periods, respectively. Company also said it lost $800,000 in FY97 Q2 revenues from strikes at Chrysler Corp and General Motors Corp.</p>
</text>
